      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Agreed, VRChat NEEDS a native linux build at this point. Although VRC works on linux through Steam's Proton, it has major re-projection and performance issues in general. There is a program that can fix these issues called Envision but it often breaks and is quite fragile with how it works. \n\nIt is time, VRC.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
